/queries/tpch/SQLStorm/
# SQLStorm queries moved out after the 2026-09-21 run (lists in logs/sqlstorm/):
# >15 s at 2.5 GHz -> slow/, rejected by PostgreSQL -> errors/
/queries/slow/tpch/sqlstorm/
/queries/errors/tpch/sqlstorm/
